## Scalability

The architecture allows processing capacity to be increased by adding additional worker processes.

```text
                Redis
                  |
        +---------+---------+
        |         |         |
        v         v         v
     Worker 1  Worker 2  Worker 3
        |         |         |
        +---------+---------+
                  |
                  v
             More Throughput
```

Because workers are independent consumers of the same queue, additional workers can be introduced without changing the client-side application.

