## Project Objective

The primary objective of this project is to demonstrate the design and implementation of a distributed background processing system capable of handling asynchronous and long-running workloads.

The project focuses on practical backend engineering concepts such as queue-based architecture, worker distribution, concurrency, fault handling, retries, persistent job tracking, real-time event communication, and scalable task processing.
